###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Monitor
:Monitor rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" ;
         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" ;
         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" ;
         rdfs:comment "To check, supervise, observe critically or record the progress of an activity, action or system on a regular basis in order to identify change." ;
         rdfs:label "Monitor" ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "To check, supervise, observe critically or record the progress of an activity, action or system on a regular basis in order to identify change." ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Monitor" .


