###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskTolerance
:RiskTolerance rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" ;
               rdfs:comment "An organisation’s or stakeholder’s readiness to bear the risk after risk treatment in order to achieve its objectives." ;
               rdfs:label "Risk Tolerance" ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "An organisation’s or stakeholder’s readiness to bear the risk after risk treatment in order to achieve its objectives." ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Risk Tolerance" .


